What this repository contains
-----------------------------

Tools, documentation, and translations of the game's text into other languages.

What it deliberately does not contain
-------------------------------------

Any part of the game: no executable, no romfs, no bundles, no artwork, no fonts,
and **not one line of the original Japanese script**. Translations are stored as
a key plus a fingerprint of the source string, never the source string itself
(docs/specs/SPEC-005-translation-keys.md), and translated artwork is stored as
the difference against a texture that only you have.

The tools read the game from *your own legally obtained copy*, on your own
machine, and write a mod that only works if you already have that copy. Nothing
is uploaded anywhere.

Do not ask this project for game files, and do not open issues or pull requests
that include them, including screenshots of the original script.
